# Keep Vercel uploads/clones lean. Do NOT ignore `shared/` — frontend imports `@shared/*`.
# Do NOT ignore `backend/` — the API project's Root Directory is `backend/`, and this
# .vercelignore applies to both projects during git-based clones.
Documentation/
Datasets/
Coursework files/
All current frontend designs/
Examples/
contracts/
scripts/
test/
ml-service/
artifacts/
cache/
coverage/
typechain-types/
deployments/
.cursor/
.githooks/
.tmp/
Previous Dev/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
*.pdf
*.mp4
*.zip
.env
.env.*
